WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.890
I’ll destroy both good and evil shinobi…

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.520
With this blade of revenge…

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.410
And with the youma!

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.950
With the youma?

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.210
My name is Rasetsu.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.970
As Fubuki’s blade,

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:18.970
I will destroy you.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:20.690
Seriously?

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.580
A talking youma?

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.080
Everybody!

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:50.940
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:51.690
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:52.400
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:52.740
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.030
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.030
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.440
Homura-san!

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.440
Homura!

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.200
Destroy the shinobi?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.450
That’s a pretty big goal.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:28.000
The youma from the Kikai Dome?

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.740
I detected signs that the door
to the other world was about to open.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:35.500
That was the beginning of it all.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.130
Good and evil ninjas…

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:41.070
You two were enemies,

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.660
but you both work
together to defeat the youma.

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:45.760
Why?

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.060
It’s obvious why!

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.530
Because the youma
are a threat to everyone.

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:53.220
A threat?

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.020
How can you be sure?

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.920
How?

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:00.030
Because the head shinobi all said…

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:04.030
Is everything the shinobi
leaders say true?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.540
Shut up!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.150
Youma killed my mother!

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.840
That’s enough to prove
they’re a danger to me!

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:21.850
And you don’t think the youma
killed by shinobi had families?

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:23.590
What?!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.960
Youma are said to attack humans.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:32.000
But what if the shinobi
attacked them first?

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:36.610
We only fought to protect ourselves.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.090
Nonsense!

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:40.140
I can’t believe that!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.810
Even if I said I had proof?

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:47.960
What?!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.310
I’ll show that proof now—

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.130
Enough!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:04.610
Everybody, stop listening to her!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.380
If you’re going to keep telling lies…

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.010
I’ll defeat you!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.930
That’s a surprise.

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.930
She still had that much power left?

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:18.720
It doesn’t matter.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.900
We wanted to declare war, and we did.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:23.980
Let’s go, Rasetsu.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.160
Asuka-san!

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.100
Fubuki-sama!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.120
Wait!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:59.640
Don’t think you’ll be able
to stay on the sidelines forever.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.990
Asuka?

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.500
Sorry, Sister Katsu.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.750
It took a long time to come save you.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.860
That’s right.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.600
I can’t grab any boobs
while I’m tied up like this.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.700
Hibari, are you okay?

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.090
Are you hurt?

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.090
I’m okay.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.050
It doesn’t hurt anywhere.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.760
I think I’m just a little hungry.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.400
Are you okay, Asuka-san?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.770
You seem pretty tired.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.020
Yeah.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:44.190
Listen, everybody, I…

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.700
You’re as bouncy as ever!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.910
Sister Katsu,

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.880
I’m about to say something important!

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:59.460
You can tell us something
important later.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:04.080
Wipe that angry look
off your face and relax a little!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.090
But…

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.390
Come on,

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.840
just do as I tell you!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.800
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.130
Sister Katsu!

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:15.970
Wait!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.780
No, no waiting!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:20.600
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.990
Katsuragi’s great.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.100
She turned her back
to normal in an instant,

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:32.920
after we tried so hard and couldn’t.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.860
Yeah, you’re right.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.800
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:43.130
Katsuragi-san, that’s enough.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.130
Okay! Your turn next, Ikaruga.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.690
Stop it!

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.720
Your mouth says, „Stop,“
but your boobs say, „Yes!“

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.020
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.770
Sister Katsu, there’s no time for this.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.680
There’s no convincing her otherwise.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.920
She’s always the same.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.720
That’s how we all should be.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:10.530
We’re always who we are,
no matter what’s going on.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.930
Let’s not change.
Let’s keep doing our best,

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.080
Asuka-chan.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.460
Yeah!

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:18.660
You’re right!

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:26.870
You’re aware that three weeks ago,

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.880
a huge hole opened on Kikai Island.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.050
Yes, I saw it on the news.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:35.000
That is a door to another world.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.960
And a large number of youma
are predicted to appear there.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:42.810
The shinobi leaders
decided to send every jonin

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:47.060
to deal with this unprecedented threat.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.200
Regardless of whether
they were good or evil.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.530
I see.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:54.200
That’s why Hanzo’s place was closed.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:58.200
Kiriya-sensei and Daidouji-senpai
are there too, right?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.300
Yes.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:03.960
But after they landed,
we lost contact with them.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.460
No…

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.860
For now, we just have to believe

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:13.170
that they’ll defeat all the
youma and come back.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.780
Yeah.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.720
I’ll believe, too!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.980
Our immediate problem
is Fubuki’s final proclamation.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:30.240
She made it sound like something
was going to happen soon.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:33.480
The most likely explanation is a youma attack.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.970
The problem, then, is that we don’t
have much in the way of fighting strength.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:42.250
We shinobi students will have
to fight the youma ourselves!

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.500
Fine with me.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:50.100
I’ve always wanted a full-on
fight with the youma.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.260
Will we have to fight Fubuki-san, too?

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:02.810
But what is she doing with the youma, anyway?

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:09.490
Are those two okay?

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:12.530
I’ll go talk to them.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:17.160
Gekkou-san, Senkou-san…

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.610
Wait!

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:22.370
What do you want?

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.570
I’m not sure what to say to that.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.470
Um,

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:32.250
can you tell me more about Fubuki-san?

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.730
We researched everything
we could find about Kurokage-sama.

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:44.270
There was a record of him taking
in another girl besides you and your friends.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:47.480
We searched long and hard for her,

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:51.390
praying that she would have
inherited Kurokage-sama’s beliefs.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:55.280
And that was Fubuki-san.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.870
That’s enough, right?

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:01.140
There’s no point in telling you
about the Fubuki-sama we know.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:04.030
She abandoned us.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:19.510
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:19.510
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:27.070
We walked together like this
on that day, didn’t we?

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:29.520
Yes, we did.

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:44.830
Um… are you…?

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.190
I am Fubuki.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.410
I knew it!

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:53.340
Why have you come here?

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:56.930
Would you tell us about
Kurokage-sama?

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:00.480
We want to carry on his beliefs.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.920
And so…

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.680
I see.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:07.480
Then we have a lot to talk about.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:17.450
We learned of the path we must follow
from Kurokage-sama and Fubuki-sama.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:21.450
But right now, we’re the
same as this waterfall.

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.510
Falling toward an end with no future.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:29.720
What do we do now?

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:33.980
Go back to the life we had
before we met the two of them?

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.980
Those empty days…

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.210
I couldn’t handle that.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.420
Agreed.

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.140
Then…

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:42.460
Yes.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.690
<i>Somehow, I have a terrible premonition.</i>

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:57.450
Gekkou-san! Senkou-san!

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.700
Don’t be stupid.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.280
Leave us alone.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.420
We’ve lost Kurokage-sama’s beliefs,

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.640
and been betrayed by Fubuki-sama.

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:09.710
There’s no reason for us to live.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.710
Beliefs… betrayal?

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.320
Are they worth dying over?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.210
What do you know?

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.500
Nothing.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:24.970
I haven’t gone through what you have.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.970
Then keep quiet.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.920
Stay away from us.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.390
Let’s talk some more.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.900
Talk?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.490
Yes.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:39.480
I want to talk with you more

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.010
about Kurokage-sama’s justice.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.810
There’s nothing left to say.

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:46.490
We were wrong.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:50.190
We didn’t know anything
about Kurokage-sama.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:54.760
There was no way we could
understand his justice.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:59.630
He didn’t say anything
that difficult, I don’t think.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:05.960
I’m sorry.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.910
Was my hand cold?

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:11.530
No, it isn’t.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:15.520
It’s warm. Very warm.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.130
I see.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:18.520
I’m glad.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:23.530
This must be the justice
Grandfather Kurokage reached.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.660
What’s important is warmth.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:32.160
Justice exists to protect
the people close to you.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.790
Can you feel how I feel?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.800
How Grandfather Kurokage feels?

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:45.810
Yes…

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:55.610
That takes care of Gekkou and Senkou.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:58.260
I’m still a little worried.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:01.310
Maybe I should have Ikaruga-san
and the others stay with them.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:04.180
Homura-chan, can you tell them for me?

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:06.060
Wait! Where are you going?

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:11.500
If you want to tell Ikaruga, do it yourself.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.080
There’s tons of things I want to ask you.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.080
For one thing—

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.080
Homura-chan…

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:21.730
You said you’d accept
my feelings, right?

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:23.080
Yes, I did.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:30.090
Then watch me follow the path
of the shinobi to its end.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.840
What does that mean?

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.610
Hey, Asuka!

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:37.920
What is she thinking?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.470
Hey, what do we do for lunch?

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:46.680
We’re stuck here until Suzune-sensei
gives us more orders.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:48.360
So we can’t leave.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.870
Which means ramen!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:54.040
Why instant ramen?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.120
We could get something
from the cafeteria.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:15:01.220
No, you know our cafeteria
doesn’t have ramen.

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:03.530
But why ramen?

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:06.880
Is there anything you want,
Gekkou-san? Senkou-san?

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.440
No, not really.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.130
We…

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:15.050
Then instant ramen it is!

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:18.640
Tonkotsu, soy sauce, salt, miso,
niboshi, iekei…

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.840
I’ve got it all!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.390
And if that doesn’t work,

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.050
boob ramen!

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:27.550
What are you doing?

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:30.660
I love the texture!

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.660
Squeeze, squeeze!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.900
Knock it off.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.040
Here.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.650
This is squid ramen,
which I recommend.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:44.050
It’s good.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.630
Um…

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.560
What is it, Gekkou-san?

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.610
You’re not mad?

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:01.060
We…

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.620
Oh, when you tied us up?

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.010
Yes.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.570
Of course I’m mad.

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:15.950
I’m mad at myself for losing to you.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.320
Even if you caught us off guard,
a match is a match.

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:22.830
No hard feelings.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.980
Your ramen will get soggy!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.650
Hurry and eat!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:27.980
Okay!

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:32.370
We’ll keep practicing,

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.590
and someday we can fight again.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.090
Well, if we had a rematch,
I’d win for sure.

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:40.850
I’d be willing to fight now to prove it.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.610
Don’t say that!

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:46.690
I’ll stop liking you!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.290
Hibari, I don’t want that…

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.360
Please don’t hate me.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.330
Then say to Gekkou-chan
and Senkou-chan,

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.870
„Let’s both do our best!“

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:05.370
From now on, let’s both do our best!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:06.970
Okay…

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:14.530
Just relax a little.

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:16.730
Stop it!

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:23.140
We have to come together
to fight the youma, okay?

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.150
Stop it! Hey!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.820
If we want to come together,

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:32.150
there’s one shinobi we’re missing.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:34.410
You mean Asuka-san.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.410
We haven’t heard from
her since then, I heard.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:46.300
I told you,

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.170
if you don’t relax,
I’ll squeeze your boobs.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.620
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:51.260
No!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.060
Stop it, Katsuragi.

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.170
Let go.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.170
I’m s-sorry.

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:00.540
Nice, Senkou!

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:01.930
Shut up!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.200
Enough.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.620
I’m done talking with you.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.910
Why aren’t we looking for her?

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:10.940
Aren’t you worried?

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:18.400
I’m sure she has something to do.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.450
Once that’s done,

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.910
she’ll come back to us.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.160
So we’ll believe in her and wait.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.600
Believe, and wait.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:35.120
That’s the best thing
we can do for her right now.

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:44.050
Asuka?

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.010
Is Kagura-chan here?

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:50.120
Kagura is storing up her power
for the battle with the youma.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.520
I’m afraid she can’t see anyone now.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:55.770
Wait.

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:58.410
Kagura gave you power already.

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.410
There’s nothing else
you should need from her.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.160
I want to talk to her.

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:07.420
You really do intend to use
that power, don’t you?

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.660
That’s been my plan from the start.

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.170
I see.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:15.130
Kagura! Kagura!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.680
Coming!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:23.420
Asuka-chan, what did
you want to talk about?

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:28.440
I want you to promise
to leave the youma to me.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.250
I can’t do that.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:35.200
Beating them is my job.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.310
Please!

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:38.100
Hey, Asuka…

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.820
It’s the second time I’ve
seen that face of yours.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:47.200
A way to seal the youma
without killing them?

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.040
You know of one, don’t you, Kagura-chan?

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.170
Of course I do.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.210
But why seal them?

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:57.210
It’s easier to beat them, I think.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.210
That won’t work!

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.050
You’ve got your reasons, huh?

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.220
Okay.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.380
I’ll tell you!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.100
If you really insist,
I can leave you in charge.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:11.860
Hey, Kagura…

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:16.330
But you still haven’t actually
sealed one, have you?

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.600
Can you get it right on your first try?

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.890
Well…

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.840
Want to try?

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:26.550
I’ll open the door to the
other world just a little.

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.580
Super-Secret Ninja Art:

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.920
Fuma Korin!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.300
Great job, Asuka-chan!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:46.890
But don’t ever forget!

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:51.320
If you keep using that super-secret
ninja art, you’ll die!

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:02.900
I’m willing to die if I must.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.770
Is that bear your friend?

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:06.410
Yeah, we’re always together!

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:11.100
Then you need to take care of it.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:24.010
The islands of Japan and Kikai
are connected by a ley line.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.930
Which means…

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:30.290
The door to the other
world is connected as well.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.690
Now, it’s time to begin.

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:46.510
Yumi-chan, turn on the TV!

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.470
Yumi, that’s…

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:33.760
I don’t have any feelings,
so I don’t get it.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:36.370
Me neither. It doesn’t bother me.

00:23:36.370 --> 00:23:40.270
I-It doesn’t bother you because
you have watermelon tits.
